{"id":"n65890-1-10","stage":4,"title":"승강장 · 站台","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65890-1-10-1","ko":"시간이 너무 늦었으니까 택시를 타고 가자.","zh":"时间已经太晚了，我们打车走吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"2","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"늦었으니까","meaning":"缓慢，晚","explanation":"늦다：缓慢，晚；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64526","senseId":"2","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦었으니까","audio":"/audio/c3d4a9524da9302551f7.mp3"}},{"text":"택시를","meaning":"出租车","explanation":"택시：出租车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"택시","audio":"/audio/94be61a73763ee4ccdbe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18772","senseId":"1","lemma":"택시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"택시를","audio":"/audio/2fbdb0907659160b0c98.mp3"}},{"text":"타고","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타고","audio":"/audio/8aebcd33801f792f7638.mp3"}},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가자","audio":"/audio/9d6a16e0f490c47dce42.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"为了做某事而定下的时刻；或指一天中的某个时刻。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"缓慢，晚","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"64526","definition":"过了合适的时候；或错过了最佳时机。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"94be61a73763ee4c","term":"택시","zh":"出租车","audio":"/audio/94be61a73763ee4ccdbe.mp3","entryId":"18772","definition":"收费后，将客人送到其指定地点的汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/191ebf3a8a3917b69926.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65890-1-10-2","ko":"그래. 이 근처 택시 승강장이 어디에 있지?","zh":"好啊。这附近的出租车候车点在哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"근처","meaning":"附近，近处","explanation":"근처：附近，近处。","readings":[{"term":"근처","audio":"/au